    }
  }
}
```

Return list of available tools.

**Request**:

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}
```

**Response**:

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "result": {
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "tool_name",
        "description": "Clear description of what this tool does",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
